<title>JAPAN: Mitsubishi Electric - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Mitsubishi Electric - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  1.28 trln	 vs	    1.25 trln</p>
<p> Operating	    8.49		vs	   43.33</p>
<p> Current	     24.04		vs	   37.43</p>
<p> Net		   16.34		vs	   18.85</p>
<p> EPS		    7.61 yen	  vs	    8.78 yen</p>
<p> Shares	   2.15 billion	  vs	2.15 billion</p>
<p> Interim div	  5.00 yen	  vs	    5.00 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Mitsubishi Electric Corp is a comprehensive electric machinery maker.</p>
